		(uuid "437da7b3-a63e-4fb3-a80d-d751461d222f")
	)
	(text_box "100kΩと8.2kΩの合成抵抗は\n(100k * 8.2k) / (100k + 8.2k)\n= 7.57855822551 ≒ 7.58kΩ\nインピーダンスは許容範囲(10kΩ)内\n\n分圧比は\nR2 / (R1 + R2)\n= 8.2 / 108.2\n= 0.0757855822551 ≒ 0.0758\n\nGND基準で考えると\nCell3 = 12.6V * 0.0758 ≒ 0.955V\nCell2 = 8.4V * 0.0758 ≒ 0.637V\nCell1 = 4.2V * 0.0758 ≒ 0.318V"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 199.39 63.4515 0)
		(size 36.83 30.5285)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7e4ba428-84f1-417a-a78d-70fa63937541")
	)
	(text_box "ADCは10bitだから\n1.1V / 1024\n≒ 1.07mV/LSB"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 106.68 75.7824 0)
		(size 17.78 8.0376)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a531edfa-0ef8-4184-a4ed-82beaf5ff4ad")
	)
	(text_box "一番単純なプログラム\n\nはじめ\n↓\n放電FETすべてOFF　オンボードLED消灯\n↓\n電圧測定\n↓\nDIPスイッチからモード判別＆目標電圧決定\n↓\n必要なら放電開始　所定の放電FETをON　オンボードLED点灯\n（不要なら「はじめ」に戻る）\n↓\n数秒待つ\n↓\n「はじめ」に戻る"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 91.44 159.6923 0)
		(size 53.34 34.6177)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "dcd00241-b0a9-4141-833f-6d1ff691ae95")
	)
	(text_box "FETのQ_{G}は9nC\n放電電流は0.17A\nスイッチング時間はだいたい\n9nC / 0.17A\n= 1.80μs"
